# Secrets, anywhere in the repository: every file meant for them is named so it's ignored.
# .env.local (and .env.*.local) for scripts and Vite; .dev.vars for the server's Worker.
# Committed .env files are public (scripts/check-env.mjs checks).
.env*.local
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
